[I] A debugger for the Go programming language

[T] A debugger for the Go programming language.

[U] https://github.com/go-delve/delve

[A] Derek Parker
[M] Daniel Ashkenazi <daniel.ashkenazi@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

